Derived work
------------
Portions of this project are derived from TCM-Meridian
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20725779), Copyright 2026 Hong-Wen Hsieh, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The derived parts are the line-level record-edit engine, the version
history, the source-tag and human-edit tagging logic, the diff rendering helpers, the atomic file
writing helper, and the clinical record-keeping and hallucination-review prompt contents
(adapted and changed for this project).

Portions of the speech pipeline (mini/voice/: microphone capture and WAV writing, audio windowing,
the ASR worker subprocess, forced-alignment mapping, text edit helpers, the rolling transcript
correction logic and prompt, and the remote-microphone streaming protocol and browser capture script,
mini/voice/remote.py and mini/ui/remote_capture.js) are derived from voice_to_text
(https://github.com/TCM-Dr-Hsieh/voice_to_text), Copyright 2026 Hong-Wen Hsieh, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (adapted and changed for this project).

Third-party software and models (not included in this repository)
------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository does not contain third-party code or model weights. setup.ps1 installs
dependencies from their own distributions (PyPI, PyTorch) and downloads models from
Hugging Face; each remains under its own license, which you must comply with. The main
components and the licenses declared in their package metadata at the time of writing:

  NiceGUI                              MIT
  httpx                                BSD
  SoundCard                            BSD
  PyAV (av)                            BSD-3-Clause
  NumPy                                BSD-3-Clause (and others, see its distribution)
  opencc-python-reimplemented          Apache-2.0
  PyTorch (torch)                      BSD
  Hugging Face transformers            Apache-2.0
  Hugging Face huggingface_hub         Apache-2.0
  safetensors                          Apache-2.0
  qwen-asr                             Apache-2.0

  Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B                  Apache-2.0 (model weights, downloaded at install time)
  Qwen/Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B        Apache-2.0 (model weights, downloaded at install time)

The full list of installed packages is pinned in constraints.txt (UI environment) and
requirements-asr.txt (speech-recognition environment). Review the license of each package
before redistributing a bundled copy of an installed environment.

